{"id":30,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\ReflectionPositivity.lean\n-- 1526 lines, 94678 bytes --\n 1 | /-\n 2 | # Reflection Positivity on the Lattice\n 3 | \n 4 | Reflection positivity (Osterwalder-Schrader positivity) is the key axiom\n 5 | connecting Euclidean quantum field theory to Minkowski quantum field theory\n 6 | via the OS reconstruction theorem.\n 7 | \n 8 | For SU(N) lattice gauge theory, reflection positivity states:\n 9 | \n10 |     ⟨f θ(f)⟩ ≥ 0\n11 | \n12 | for any observable f depending only on link variables in the positive-time\n13 | half-lattice (t > 0). Here θ is the time-reflection map:\n14 | \n15 |     (θ U)(n, μ) = U(θ n, μ)⁻¹   if μ = 0 (time direction)\n16 |     (θ U)(n, μ) = U(θ n, μ)     if μ ≠ 0 (spatial direction)\n17 | -/\n18 | \n19 | import YangMills.Lattice\n20 | import YangMills.SpecialUnitary\n21 | import YangMills.Proofs.LatticeMeasure\n22 | import YangMills.Proofs.BasicLemmas\n23 | \n24 | set_option linter.unusedVariables false\n25 | set_option maxHeartbeats 2000000\n26 | namespace YangMills\n27 | namespace Lattice\n28 | \n29 | /--\n30 | The reflection of an observable on any lattice type with `ReflectSite`:\n31 |     (θ f)(U) = f(θ U)\n32 | where θ acts on link variables via `reflectLinkVariable`.\n33 | -/\n34 | def reflectObservable (N : ℕ) {Λ : Type} [ReflectSite Λ] (f : LinkVariable (SU N) Λ → ℝ) :\n35 |     LinkVariable (SU N) Λ → ℝ :=\n36 |   λ U => f (reflectLinkVariable N U)\n37 | \n38 | lemma reflectObservable_involution (N : ℕ) {Λ : Type} [ReflectSite Λ] (f : LinkVariable (SU N) Λ → ℝ)\n39 |     (U : LinkVariable (SU N) Λ) : reflectObservable N (reflectObservable N f) U = f U := by\n40 |   dsimp [reflectObservable]\n41 |   rw [reflection_involution N U]\n42 | /--\n43 | The reflection of an observable on ℤ⁴ under the full geometric reflection:\n44 |     (θ f)(U) = f(θ U)\n45 | where θ acts on link variables via `reflectLinkVariableZ4`.\n46 | -/\n47 | def reflectObservableZ4 (N : ℕ) (f : LinkVariable (SU N) Z4Site → ℝ) : LinkVariable (SU N) Z4Site → ℝ :=\n48 |   λ U => f (reflectLinkVariableZ4 N U)\n49 | \n50 | /--\n\n... 1476 more line(s) below (use offset=51 to continue reading)","timestamp":1784083810,"token_count":664,"tool_call_id":"call_01_PVNBhfIFBe0XMjjkPgkm7958","full_token_estimate":504,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":1526,"byte_count":94678,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":8,"is_prune_marker":false}
