{"id":64,"role":"Tool","content":"Search results (5):\n\n1. [https://projecteuclid.org/journals/communications-in-mathematical-physics/volume-113/issue-3/General-proof-of-Osterwalder-Schrader-positivity-for-the-Wilson-action/cmp/1104160284.pdf]\n   PDF General Proof of Osterwalder-Schrader Positivity for the Wilson Action\n   Luscher [3] and independently Osterwalder and Seiler [4] have addressed the problem in two different ways. Luscher starting from the Wilson action builds up a Hubert space as a Fock space derived from equal time fields and explicitly constructs a transfer matrix [5] which he proves to be positive definite, in this context Osterwalder-Schrader positivity is proved for gauge invariant operators ...\n\n2. [https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/BF01221251]\n   General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action ...\n   We extend the proof by Osterwalder and Seiler of reflection positivity of lattice gauge theories with fermions to the case in which the reflection is performed with respect to planes containing sites. Our proof applies to all observables and relies on the particular structure of the Wilson action. This assures the positivity of the correlation functions 〈θ(F)F〉 for any gauge invariant ...\n\n3. [https://rd.springer.com/content/pdf/10.1007/BF01221251.pdf]\n   PDF General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action\n   Abstract. We extend theproof byOsterwalder and Seiler ofreflection positivity of lattice gauge theories with fermions tthe case inwhich t reflection e is performed with respect toplanes containing sites. Our proof applies toall observables and relies on the particular structure of the Wilson action. This assures the positivity of the correlation functions (O(F)F) for any gauge invariant ...\n\n4. [https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1987CMaPh.113..369M/abstract]\n   General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action\n   We extend the proof by Osterwalder and Seiler of reflection positivity of lattice gauge theories with fermions to the case in which the reflection is performed with respect to planes containing sites. Our proof applies to all observables and relies on the particular structure of the Wilson action. This assures the positivity of the correlation functions &lt;θ(F)F&gt; for any gauge invariant ...\n\n5. [https://www.osti.gov/etdeweb/biblio/6021032]\n   General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action\n   Abstract We extend the proof by Osterwalder and Seiler of reflection positivity of lattice gauge theories with fermions to the case in which the reflection is performed with respect to planes containing sites. Our proof applies to all observables and relies on the particular structure of the Wilson action. This assures the positivity of the correlation functions for any gauge invariant ...\n\n","timestamp":1784084154,"token_count":710,"tool_call_id":"call_00_47uJ1kzkjOH34BcqXuJQ5175","full_token_estimate":654,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"web_search","file_path":null,"old_text":"\"General proof of Osterwalder-Schrader positivity for the Wilson action\" Luscher","new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":null,"byte_count":2833,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":1560,"edit_line":null},"turn":24,"is_prune_marker":false}
