 n ∈ (positiveSites T L ∪ interfaceSites T L) → U.value n μ = V.value n μ) → f U = f V\n```\n\nWait, but this is equivalent to saying that f factors as f = g ∘ (extendLinkVariable and then restrictPosInterface).\n\nActually, a simpler formulation: f depends only on positive+interface links iff there exists g: PosInterfaceConfig N T L → ℝ such that:\nf(U) = g(restrictPosInterface(N, T, L, extendLinkVariable(N, PeriodicSite T L, Finset.univ, toFiniteLinkConfig(U))))\n\nHmm, this is getting complex. Let me just use the extensionality condition.\n\nLet me now implement the changes. I'll start with `ReflectionPositivity.lean`.","turn":34,"is_prune_marker":false}
