{"id":101,"role":"Tool","content":"C:\\github\\YangMills\\src\\lean\\YangMills\\Proofs\\ReflectionPositivity.lean\n-- 1526 lines, 94678 bytes --\n196 | \n197 | /--\n198 | The set of lattice sites at the time interface (signed time = 0).\n199 | -/\n200 | noncomputable def interfaceSites (T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L] : Finset (PeriodicSite T L) :=\n201 |   Finset.filter (λ n => signedTime T n.time = 0) Finset.univ\n202 | \n203 | /--\n204 | The positive-time part of the Wilson action.\n205 | -/\n206 | noncomputable def wilsonActionPeriodicPositive (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n207 |     (U : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)) : ℝ :=\n208 |   wilsonActionFinite N β (positiveSites T L) U\n209 | \n210 | /--\n211 | The negative-time part of the Wilson action.\n212 | -/\n213 | noncomputable def wilsonActionPeriodicNegative (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n214 |     (U : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)) : ℝ :=\n215 |   wilsonActionFinite N β (negativeSites T L) U\n216 | \n217 | /--\n218 | The interface part of the Wilson action.\n219 | -/\n220 | noncomputable def wilsonActionPeriodicInterface (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n221 |     (U : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)) : ℝ :=\n222 |   wilsonActionFinite N β (interfaceSites T L) U\n223 | \n224 | /--\n225 | The total action decomposes into positive, negative, and interface parts:\n226 |     S_W = S⁺ + S⁻ + S_int\n227 | -/\n228 | lemma total_decomposition_periodic (N T L : ℕ) (β : ℝ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\n229 |     (U : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)) :\n230 |     wilsonActionFinite N β (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) U =\n231 |     wilsonActionPeriodicPositive N T L β U +\n232 |     wilsonActionPeriodicNegative N T L β U +\n233 |     wilsonActionPeriodicInterface N T L β U := by\n234 |   unfold wilsonActionFinite\n235 |   have h_cover : (Finset.univ : Finset (PeriodicSite T L)) =\n236 |       positiveSites T L ∪ negativeSites T L ∪ interfaceSites T L := by\n237 |     ext n; simp [positiveSites, negativeSites, interfaceSites]\n238 |     by_cases hpos : signedTime T n.time > 0\n239 |     · simp [hpos]\n240 |     · by_cases hneg : signedTime T n.time < 0\n241 |       · simp [hpos, hneg]\n242 |       · have hzero : signedTime T n.time = 0 := by\n243 |           have hle : signedTime T n.time ≤ 0 := by linarith\n244 |           have hge : signedTime T n.time ≥ 0 := by linarith\n245 |           linarith\n246 |         simp [hpos, hneg, hzero]\n247 |   rw [h_cover]\n248 |   have h_disjoint_pos_neg : Disjoint (positiveSites T L) (negativeSites T L) := by\n249 |     unfold positiveSites negativeSites\n250 |     rw [Finset.disjoint_filter]\n251 |     intro n hn hpos\n252 |     intro hneg\n253 |     linarith\n254 |   have h_disjoint_neg_int : Disjoint (negativeSites T L) (interfaceSites T L) := by\n255 |     unfold negativeSites interfaceSites\n256 |     rw [Finset.disjoint_filter]\n257 |     intro n hn hneg\n258 |     intro hzero\n259 |     linarith\n260 |   have h_disjoint_pos_int : Disjoint (positiveSites T L) (interfaceSites T L) := by\n261 |     unfold positiveSites interfaceSites\n262 |     rw [Finset.disjoint_filter]\n263 |     intro n hn hpos\n264 |     intro hzero\n265 |     linarith\n266 |   have h_disjoint_union_int : Disjoint (positiveSites T L ∪ negativeSites T L) (interfaceSites T L) := by\n267 |     rw [Finset.disjoint_union_left]\n268 |     exact ⟨h_disjoint_pos_int, h_disjoint_neg_int⟩\n269 |   calc\n270 |     ∑ n ∈ (positiveSites T L ∪ negativeSites T L) ∪ interfaceSites T L,\n271 |         ∑ μ : Fin 4, ∑ ν : Fin 4, plaquetteContribution N β U n μ ν\n272 |         = (∑ n ∈ positiveSites T L ∪ negativeSites T L,\n273 |             ∑ μ : Fin 4, ∑ ν : Fin 4, plaquetteContribution N β U n μ ν) +\n274 |           (∑ n ∈ interfaceSites T L,\n275 |             ∑ μ : Fin 4, ∑ ν : Fin 4, plaquetteContribution N β U n μ ν) := by\n276 |       rw [Finset.sum_union h_disjoint_union_int]\n277 |     _ = (∑ n ∈ positiveSites T L,\n278 |             ∑ μ : Fin 4, ∑ ν : Fin 4, plaquetteContribution N β U n μ ν) +\n279 |         (∑ n ∈ negativeSites T L,\n280 |             ∑ μ : Fin 4, ∑ ν : Fin 4, plaquetteContribution N β U n μ ν) +\n281 |         (∑ n ∈ interfaceSites T L,\n282 |             ∑ μ : Fin 4, ∑ ν : Fin 4, plaquetteContribution N β U n μ ν) := by\n283 |       rw [Finset.sum_union h_disjoint_pos_neg, add_assoc]\n284 |     _ = wilsonActionPeriodicPositive N T L β U + wilsonActionPeriodicNegative N T L β U +\n285 |         wilsonActionPeriodicInterface N T L β U := by\n286 |       unfold wilsonActionPeriodicPositive wilsonActionPeriodicNegative wilsonActionPeriodicInterface wilsonActionFinite\n287 |       rfl\n288 | /-! ### Osterwalder-Seiler decomposition (plaquette-based) -/\n289 | \n290 | section OSDecomposition\n291 | \n292 | open Matrix\n293 | open scoped BigOperators\n294 | \n295 | /-- Index type for oriented plaquettes on a periodic lattice: (base site, μ, ν). -/\n\n... 1231 more line(s) below (use offset=296 to continue reading)","timestamp":1784084339,"token_count":1534,"tool_call_id":"call_00_DFs8jY5lYvSFohebkjO12166","full_token_estimate":1133,"tool_meta":{"tool_name":"read_file","file_path":"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean","old_text":null,"new_text":null,"exit_code":null,"line_count":1526,"byte_count":94678,"is_error":false,"duration_ms":0,"edit_line":null},"turn":41,"is_prune_marker":false}
{"id":102,"role":"Assistant","content":"","timestamp":1784084346,"token_count":0,"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\": \"src/lean/YangMills/Proofs/ReflectionPositivity.lean\", \"start_line\": 286, \"end_line\": 292, \"new_text\": \"      rfl\\n\\n/--\\nA function `f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ` depends only on\\npositive-time and interface (time-0) links iff its value is determined by\\nthe values of the link variable on `positiveSites T L ∪ interfaceSites T L`.\\nThis is the correct hypothesis for the Osterwalder-Seiler reflection positivity\\ntheorem: only observables localized in the positive-time region (including the\\ninterface at time 0) are required to satisfy ⟨θf, f⟩ ≥ 0.\\n\\n⚠️ **Mathematical note**: The lemma `gibbsExpectationPeriodic_reflection_positive`\\nas originally stated (without this hypothesis) is **false** in general.  A\\ncounterexample exists even for β=0 (free theory): take\\n`f(U) = a(U(ℓ))·b(U(θℓ)) - a(U(θℓ))·b(U(ℓ))` for a positive-site link ℓ\\nand its reflection θℓ.  Then `f·θf = -(f)²` and its integral is strictly negative.\\nThe hypothesis that `f` depends only on positive+interface links excludes such\\ncounterexamples.\\n-/\\ndef dependsOnlyOnPosInterface (N T L : ℕ) [NeZero T] [NeZero L]\\n    (f : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L) → ℝ) : Prop :=\\n  ∀ (U V : LinkVariable (SU N) (PeriodicSite T L)),\\n    (∀ (n : PeriodicSite T L) (μ : Fin 4),\\n      n ∈ (positiveSites T L ∪ interfaceSites T L) → U.value n μ = V.value n μ) → f U = f V\\n\\n/-! ### Osterwalder-Seiler decomposition (plaquette-based) -/\"}","name":"patch_lines"},"id":"call_00_ePLiaknINZ8bMGR6LHwE3280","type":"function"}],"full_token_estimate":487,"reasoning_content":"I'll add the `dependsOnlyOnPosInterface` definition right before the `OSDecomposition` section header. Let me now make all the changes.\n\nI need to:\n1. Add `dependsOnlyOnPosInterface` definition before the OSDecomposition section\n2. Update `gibbsExpectationPeriodic_reflection_positive` to require the hypothesis\n3. Update `PeriodicExpectation` structure\n4. Update `wilsonPeriodicExpectation`\n5. Update `lattice_ym_reflection_positive_periodic`\n6. Update `TransferMatrix.lean`\n\nLet me do this systematically.","turn":42,"is_prune_marker":false}
