on in kernel)\",\"id\":\"5.7\",\"priority\":\"high\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"Phase 7: Continuum limit / OS reconstruct / mass gap (long-term)\",\"id\":\"6\",\"priority\":\"medium\",\"status\":\"pending\"},{\"content\":\"exp_reTrace_positiveDefinite (PositiveDefinite.lean) — needs Peter-Weyl theorem\",\"id\":\"7\",\"priority\":\"low\",\"status\":\"pending\"}]}","name":"project_task_list"},"id":"call_00_OaQwPgP916Tp655JE5Uc6063","type":"function"}],"full_token_estimate":566,"reasoning_content":"Now let me update the project task list and then provide a handoff with comprehensive notes.","turn":52,"is_prune_marker":false}
